{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2021-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'DANAHER ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'WASHINGTON, DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.21 PER SHARE OF ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 28, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 30, 2021. IN ADDITION, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $11.875 PER SHARE OF ITS 4.75% SERIES A MANDATORY CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 15, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 31, 2021.'}